      "layerStep": "Layer 3"
    }
  },
  {
    "title": "The embedding",
    "narration": "The arrowheads reach the top face: this is the embedding. Read bottom-up, the whole stack is representation learning.",
    "state": {
      "direction": "Representation learning (up)",
      "layerStep": "Embedding face"
    }
  },
  {
    "title": "Flip the reading",
    "narration": "Toggle to generative modeling: the arrows reverse and the same paths now carry points downward from the embedding into data. One architecture, two readings.",
