                              true box 5 (X) × 8 (Y) × 5 (Z), centered at origin
   3 interior layers        → Mesh(PlaneGeometry(5,5), rotX -PI/2) #e6e6e6 a.55
   layer outlines           → 4 tubes per plane r=0.020  #4a4a4a (active #111)
   5 dotted paths           → InstancedMesh(SphereGeometry(0.042)) #1f1f1f dots
                              spaced along a Catmull-Rom curve through 5 height keys
                              (wide fan across the footprint, curves cross)
   5 start dots             → SphereGeometry(0.10): 3 black low near Data face
                              (left / center / right), 2 grey on the lowest plane
   5 path arrowheads        → ConeGeometry(0.14,0.44) at y≈3.4, along the tangent
   left side arrow  (UP)    → tube shaft r=0.075 + ConeGeometry(0.26,0.75) top
   right side arrow (DOWN)  → tube shaft r=0.075 + cone at bottom
   5 traversal markers      → SphereGeometry(0.12) #262626, hidden by default
   labels                   → addLabel HTML serif (2 rotated 90° CCW)
